{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Validate every envelope scalar type.** The subsequent Jackson binding still coerces numeric `data`, `reference`, and owner fields, string attempts, and numeric enums inside `producerContext`, so malformed v1 envelopes can be accepted instead of failing closed. Disable scalar coercion for this mapper or validate the complete JSON schema before binding, with tests for these fields.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7onWKc","finding_digest":"d125247bade6c63642bf5eac4ba8e95ebcf5653665debda708f724915819edb6","finding_id":"arf_v1_2essi65n43ddmqv7l2wexkhjl2","finding_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::envelope-serdes::strict-scalar-types","identity_key":"sdk/execution/payloadcodec::envelope-serdes::strict-scalar-types","line":265,"observation_digest":"c3c29a7fd7d9ed305e9d29ffcf07dd0e07d7a119e163b24ccc20710f22e9131f","observation_id":"aro_v1_ypbju76x3hwtaxu5fh746b65by","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/PayloadCodec.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2essi65n43ddmqv7l2wexkhjl2","published_at":"2026-09-01T09:16:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_uk25wro7hzsaazcmfdmuvbyu5a","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"6c619383c8c605b87c7b2560a8e94006013c7a34","reviewer":"codex","start_line":264,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_xaemcsqu3ndgt3sr5aydtlrbej","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T09:16:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
